{"id":"n57323-9-4","stage":0,"title":"치다 · 打","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57323-9-4-1","ko":"칼을 좀 쳐 주시오.","zh":"请给我打一把刀。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"칼을","meaning":"刀","explanation":"칼：刀；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"칼","audio":"/audio/4eaedee29619f832b4df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26905","senseId":"1","lemma":"칼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쳐","meaning":"打，打造","explanation":"치다：打，打造；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"9","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주시오.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；오：较传统的 하오 体句末，表示陈述、询问、请求等；不等同于最高敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4eaedee29619f832","term":"칼","zh":"刀","audio":"/audio/4eaedee29619f832b4df.mp3","entryId":"26905","definition":"用于削、切或割东西的工具。","pronunciation":["칼"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"打，打造","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"把铁块放在火中烧热之后使劲敲打，制作成工具。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c4cd2703e0f9d4ca3c6a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57323-9-4-2","ko":"크기는 어느 정도면 될까요?","zh":"要多大的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"크기는","meaning":"大小，高矮，高低","explanation":"크기：大小，高矮，高低；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"크기","audio":"/audio/82232621b82d72beac66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62458","senseId":"1","lemma":"크기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어느","meaning":"什么，多少","explanation":"어느：什么，多少","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"4","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도면","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될까요?","meaning":"为","explanation":"되다：为；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"5","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"82232621b82d72be","term":"크기","zh":"大小，高矮，高低","audio":"/audio/82232621b82d72beac66.mp3","entryId":"62458","definition":"物体的体积、宽度及量等的大小的程度。","pronunciation":["크기"]},{"id":"76e7139b030308e7","term":"어느","zh":"什么，多少","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3","entryId":"62822","definition":"一些、稍微或询问程度、数量时说的话。","pronunciation":["어느"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"表现事物的性质或价值好坏或多少的程度的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个对象的数量、费用等是多少，或地点是什么地方。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c9b2def1992c3c4d300.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.48,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57323","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"9","so